### Register user baru (+ organisasi baru)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Test User",
  "organization_name": "Test Org"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Refresh token (ganti refresh_token dengan hasil login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Logout (ganti refresh_token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Profile (ganti access_token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN

### Verify email (ganti token, cek log server kalau SMTP tidak dikonfigurasi)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/verify-email?token=VERIFY_TOKEN

### Forgot password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Reset password (ganti token, cek log server kalau SMTP tidak dikonfigurasi)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "RESET_TOKEN",
  "new_password": "newpassword123"
}

### Setup 2FA (ganti access_token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/setup
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN

### Confirm 2FA (ganti access_token & code dari authenticator app)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/confirm
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### Login step 2: selesaikan 2FA (ganti temp_token dari response login & code)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temp_token": "TEMP_TOKEN",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Disable 2FA (ganti access_token & code)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/disable
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### My organization (ganti access_token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/me
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN

### Google login
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/google/login

### GitHub login
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/github/login

### Admin dashboard (ganti access_token admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
